entries.definition_en:
Someone from the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.35.18; 
 son of: Israel (H3478) and Rachel (H7354); 
 brother of: Joseph (H3130); 
 half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Gad (H1410), Asher (H0836), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074) and Dinah (H1783); 
 father of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Jamin at 1Sa.9.1,4; 22.7; 1x
Group of bin.ya.min (בִּנְיָמִין "Benjamin" H1144) 
 § Benjamite = "a son of the right hand"
 one of the tribe of Benjamin

A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at Jer.37.3; 
 son of: Shelemiah (H8018M); also called Jucal (NIV: Jehukal) at Jer.38.1; 
Another name of ye.hu.khal (יְהוּכַל "Jehucal" H3081) 
 § Jucal = "Jehovah is able"
 a son of Shelemiah and a servant of king Zedekiah whom he sent to Jeremiah to entreat his prayers and advice

A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.15; 
 son of: Caleb (H3612); 
 brother of: Achsah (H5915), Elah (H0425J) and Naam (H5277) 
 § Iru = "watch"
 son of Caleb and grandson of Jephunneh

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at Rut.4.19; 
 son of: Hezron (H2696H); 
 brother of: Jerahmeel (H3396), Caleb (H3612H), Segub (H7687H) and Ashhur (H0806); 
 father of: Amminadab (H5992); also called Admin (KJV: Aram) at Luk.3.33; 
 § Ram = "high" or "exalted"
1) a Judaite, son of Hezron, father of Amminadab, and ancestor of David
2) a Judaite, son of Jerahmeel
3) a kindred of Elihu, the friend of Job

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.25; 
 son of: Jerahmeel (H3396); 
 brother of: Bunah (H0946), Oren (H0767), Ozem (H0684H), Ahijah (H0281J) and Onam (H0208H); 
 father of: Maaz (H4619), Jamin (H3226H) and Eker (H6134)
 § Ram = "high" or "exalted"
1) a Judaite, son of Hezron, father of Amminadab, and ancestor of David
2) a Judaite, son of Jerahmeel
3) a kindred of Elihu, the friend of Job

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.7; 
 son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Helah (H2458); 
 brother of: Haahashtari (H0326), Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328) and Koz (H6976); 
 half-brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488) 
 § Ethnan = "hire of unchastity"
 a grandson of Ashur
